      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is kinda hard to do with how the current system works. Because to get the performance rank your PC has to download the Avatar and look at it's performance stats.\n\nSo for this to work you would currently need to download all Avatars in the world first and your PC would need to evaluate it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-17T03:16:27.517Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The rankings can be placed below their respective PC/Quest icons, to show the stats for each. This will help players know whether or not the avatar is usable (Very Poor for Quest but a PC user can't see the Quest stats) or potentially hidden by a majority (Poor on Quest), or perhaps just for anyone looking to use an avatar at a decent rating without having to select the avatar to check their stats.\n\nMany things are changing in VRChat to encourage use and development of more optimized content. Avatars with more favorable ratings will be chosen more frequently if players are made aware of the avatar's Performance Ranking beforehand.",
